{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up in a maintenance room, alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your partner's journal is out in the open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You probably shouldn't read it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong> Rachel's Journal is a short (20min) atmospheric reading game. Most of the game is spent reading, and absorbing the vibrant sound design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controls:</strong> Mouse-only,\u00a0all actions are performed by left-clicking. Interaction is intuitive and context dependent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story:</strong>\u00a0You wake up on a dying colonial vessel, destined for Mars. As one of the few survivors, you're trying to save your failing mission. Unfortunately Rachel's Journal betrays the truth that\u00a0reality is a lot more complicated.\u00a0You're immersed into this world\u00a0with very little context. Sit in your sleeping bag and read as you try to figure out what's really going on.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3890660?t=1753651577","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3890660?t=1753651577","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890660/7d6caaa63630824faf107dc7881fcaeef6ec7bb5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753651577","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890660/7d6caaa63630824faf107dc7881fcaeef6ec7bb5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753651577","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"- Jumpscares\r\n- Depictions of low detail murder with a blunt object\r\n- Descriptions of implied developing mental illness"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_para